# Chessboard — Lasker vs Thomas, London 1912, opened after 17...Kg1 with one move
# left (18. Kd2#) on a react-native-chessboard board; delivering the mate by
# dragging the king flips the player pills to WON/LOST, stops the clocks, plays
# a Pulsar haptic pattern and, after 580ms, snapshots the board into a Skia
# wave-shader "checkmate aura" with a GAME REVIEW card (Back / Replay).
# What this test covers: illegal drags first (king to an occupied own square,
# a black piece on White's turn, a drag released off the board — all must snap
# back), then the mating drag Ke1-d2, the WON/LOST state, the aura + review
# card, Replay (canned replay re-animates the move from START_FEN) and Back
# (static reset), then mating again by hand.
context platform=ios
open "demos://animations/chessboard"
wait "label=\"Close\"" 45000
# Warm-up touch on the status bar: the first touch of a test can be lost while
# the XCTest runner attaches.
press 330 20
wait 500
wait "text" "lasker" 10000
wait 1500
# Squares are 50.25pt; a-file x=25, rank 1 y=605 (board top y=228).
# Illegal: Ke1 onto its own bishop on e2.
gesture pan 226 605 0 -50 600
wait 1000
# Illegal: Black's queen on e7 while White is to move.
gesture pan 226 303 0 50 600
wait 1000
# King dragged off the board and released below it.
gesture pan 226 605 0 120 600
wait 1200
# 18. Kd2#
gesture pan 226 605 -50 -50 700
wait "text" "WON" 5000
wait "text" "LOST" 3000
wait "text" "GAME REVIEW" 10000
wait 1500
press 293 811
wait "text" "WON" 15000
wait "text" "GAME REVIEW" 10000
wait 1500
press 108 811
wait 2000
# Mate again by hand after the reset.
gesture pan 226 605 -50 -50 700
wait "text" "WON" 5000
wait 5000
wait "label=\"Close\"" 15000
press "role=\"button\" label=\"Close\""
wait 1500
